<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.24.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.24.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.24.0 (2026-11-20): Chapter 17 deck 3.0.0 Done: reader notes, balloons, result balloons, no slide added (59 slides as before). The lineage stays open."@en .

ex:TK10_Deck_17_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Reader notes (59, 60 to 140 words each; 71 to 114 in fact; a slide or chapter link in each) and the result sentences of the 28 code slides in notes_v3_0_0.py; deck 03-materials/ch17/SEN0414_Ch17_PDFAndWordDocuments_3e_v3_0_0.pptx; manifest chapter_code_ch17_v1_1_0.json; story pictures and credits stay in story_images_v2_1_0.json (unchanged, so no new file)." .
ex:TK10_Deck_17_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Re-run from the files on 2026-11-20 (logs in 08-tooling/ch17-deck/logs_v3_0_0): material check 1.0.2 no failing condition, deck standard 1.1.0 13 of 13, overlap clean (after two rounds of shortening code and balloons), story prose clean, reader-notes clean on 59 slides, manifest self-check pass, story repeat check clean against chapters 1 to 16 and 18 to 20. The deck was not looked at rendered. Builder WARN lines remain on eleven examples. The notes carry facts of the chapter research and of the examples' runs; the notes' statements about the research (timings, the book's wording) were taken from deck 2.1.0 and not re-measured." .
ex:ST10_Deck_17 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Deck rebuilt on builder 2.6.0 with balloons and reader notes; see its tasks." .
ex:TK10_Page_17_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:Obs2_Obj10_ReaderNotes a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj10_ReaderNotes ; backlog:observedValue 0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-20T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "Reader-notes check 1.0.0 on chapter 17's deck 3.0.0 (59 slides): clean, as on chapters 10 and 11. The metric counts chapters 10 and 11 only." .
ex:Obs3_Obj10_DeckStandard a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj10_DeckStandard ; backlog:observedValue 0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-20T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "Deck standard 1.1.0: 13 of 13 on all three decks (chapters 11, 10 and 17)." .
ex:Obs4_Obj10_MaterialConditions a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj10_MaterialConditions ; backlog:observedValue 0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-20T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "Material check 1.0.2: no failing condition on the three decks; the three pages are not yet all built (chapter 17's is next)." .
